@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy | Kief Productions";
}

<style>
    body {
        background-color: #0a0a0a;
        color: #e0e0e0;
    }

    .privacy-wrapper {
        max-width: 860px;
        margin: 60px auto;
        padding: 0 24px 80px;
    }

    .privacy-header {
        border-bottom: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
        padding-bottom: 32px;
        margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .privacy-header .tag {
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 4px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #ff3e00;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .privacy-header h1 {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-size: 2.4rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        margin: 0 0 12px;
    }

    .privacy-header .updated {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #666;
    }

    .privacy-section {
        margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .privacy-section h2 {
        font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
        font-size: 1.1rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 1px;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
        padding-left: 14px;
        border-left: 3px solid #ff3e00;
    }

    .privacy-section p,
    .privacy-section li {
        font-size: 0.95rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #b0b0b0;
        margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .privacy-section ul {
        padding-left: 20px;
    }

    .privacy-section a {
        color: #00a8ff;
        text-decoration: none;
    }

    .privacy-section a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .privacy-contact-card {
        background: #1a1a1a;
        border: 1px solid #2a2a2a;
        border-radius: 10px;
        padding: 24px 28px;
        margin-top: 16px;
    }

    .privacy-contact-card p {
        margin: 0 0 6px;
    }
</style>

<div class="privacy-wrapper">

    <div class="privacy-header">
        <p class="tag">Legal</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="updated">Last updated: 8 May 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            Kief Productions ("we", "us", "our") is committed to protecting your personal information in accordance with
            the <strong style="color:#fff;">Protection of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA)</strong>.
            This policy explains what information we collect, why we collect it, how we use it, and your rights regarding that information.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>When you submit our contact form, we collect the following personal information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Full name</li>
            <li>Email address</li>
            <li>Phone number (optional)</li>
            <li>Preferred event date</li>
            <li>Event or enquiry details</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not collect any sensitive personal information as defined under POPIA.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>3. Why We Collect Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use your personal information solely to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Respond to your enquiry or quote request</li>
            <li>Communicate with you about your event requirements</li>
            <li>Provide the production services you have requested</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We will not use your information for any purpose other than the one for which it was collected without your prior consent.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>4. How We Store Your Information</h2>
        <p>
            Contact form submissions are delivered directly to our internal email inbox and are not stored in a public-facing database.
            We take reasonable technical and organisational measures to protect your personal information from unauthorised access, loss, or misuse.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>5. Sharing of Information</h2>
        <p>
            We do not sell, trade, or otherwise transfer your personal information to third parties.
            Your information is only accessible to Kief Productions staff directly involved in handling your enquiry.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
        <p>
            Our website does not currently use tracking cookies or analytics that collect personal information.
            Standard server logs may record your IP address and browser type for security and performance purposes only.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>7. Your Rights Under POPIA</h2>
        <p>You have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Request access to the personal information we hold about you</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate or outdated information</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your personal information</li>
            <li>Object to the processing of your personal information</li>
            <li>Lodge a complaint with the <strong style="color:#fff;">Information Regulator of South Africa</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise any of these rights, contact us using the details below.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>8. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected on this page with an updated date.
            We encourage you to review this policy periodically.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how your information is handled, please contact us:</p>
        <div class="privacy-contact-card">
            <p><strong style="color:#fff;">Kief Productions</strong></p>
            <p>Pretoria, Gauteng, South Africa</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@kiefproductions.co.za">info@kiefproductions.co.za</a></p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>
